{"suttaId":"thag1.33","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[197,200],"vripara":"33"},"segments":{"thag1.33:0.4":"Sopākattheragāthā","thag1.33:1.1":"“Yathāpi ekaputtasmiṃ, piyasmiṃ kusalī siyā;","thag1.33:1.3":"Evaṃ sabbesu pāṇesu, sabbattha kusalo siyā”ti.","thag1.33:1.5":"… Sopāko thero …."},"attha":{"book":"Th-a-i","bookName":"Theragāthā-1-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0508a1.att","from":1060,"to":1060,"paras":[{"para":1060,"vripara":"33","refs":["thag1.33:1"],"lines":["Tattha <b>yathā</b>ti opammatthe nipāto.","<b>Ekaputtasmin</b>ti punāti ca kulavaṃsaṃ tāyati cāti putto, atrajādibhedo putto.","Eko putto ekaputto, tasmiṃ ekaputtasmiṃ.","Visaye cetaṃ bhummavacanaṃ.","<b>Piyasmin</b>ti piyāyitabbatāya ceva ekaputtatāya ca rūpasīlācārādīhi ca pemakaraṇaṭṭhānabhūte.","<b>Kusalī</b>ti kusalaṃ vuccati khemaṃ sotthibhāvo, taṃ labhitabbaṃ etassa atthīti kusalī, sattānaṃ hitesī mettajjhāsayo.","<b>Sabbesu pāṇesū</b>ti sabbesu sattesu.","<b>Sabbatthā</b>ti sabbāsu disāsu sabbesu vā bhavādīsu, sabbāsu vā avatthāsu.","Idaṃ vuttaṃ hoti – yathā ekaputtake piye manāpe mātāpitā kusalī ekantahitesī bhaveyya, evaṃ puratthimādibhedāsu sabbāsu disāsu, kāmabhavādibhedesu sabbesu bhavesu daharādibhedāsu sabbāsu avatthāsu ca ṭhitesu sabbesu sattesu ekantahitesitāya kusalī bhaveyya,“mitto udāsīno pañcatthiko”ti sīmaṃ akatvā sīmāsambhedavasena sabbattha ekarasaṃ mettaṃ bhāveyyāti.","Imaṃ pana gāthaṃ vatvā “sace tumhe āyasmanto evaṃ mettābhāvanaṃ anuyuñjeyyātha, ye te bhagavatā ‘sukhaṃ supatī’tiādinā (a. ni.11.15) ekādasa mettānisaṃsā vuttā, ekaṃsena tesaṃ bhāgino bhavathā”ti ovādamadāsi."],"lineRefs":[["thag1.33:1"],["thag1.33:1"],["thag1.33:1"],["thag1.33:1"],["thag1.33:1"],["thag1.33:1"],["thag1.33:1"],["thag1.33:1"],["thag1.33:1"],["thag1.33:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["thag1.33:1.1","yathā",0,0],["thag1.33:1.1","ekaputtasmiṃ",0,1],["thag1.33:1.1","piyasmiṃ",0,4],["thag1.33:1.1","kusalī",0,5],["thag1.33:1.3","kusalī",0,5],["thag1.33:1.3","sabbesu pāṇesū",0,6],["thag1.33:1.3","sabbatthā",0,7]],"before":[{"para":996,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Varuṇo nāma nāmena, brāhmaṇo mantapāragū;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":997,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Chaḍḍetvā dasa puttāni, vanamajjhogahiṃ tadā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":998,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Assamaṃ sukataṃ katvā, suvibhattaṃ manoramaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":999,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Paṇṇasālaṃ karitvāna, vasāmi vipine ahaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1000,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Padumuttaro lokavidū, āhutīnaṃ paṭiggaho;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1001,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Mamuddharitukāmo so, āgacchi mama assamaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1002,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Yāvatā vanasaṇḍamhi, obhāso vipulo ahu;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1003,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Buddhassa ānubhāvena, pajjalī vipinaṃ tadā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1004,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Disvāna taṃ pāṭihīraṃ, buddhaseṭṭhassa tādino;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1005,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Pattapuṭaṃ gahetvāna, phalena pūjayiṃ ahaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1006,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Upagantvāna sambuddhaṃ, sahakhārimadāsahaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1007,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Anukampāya me buddho, idaṃ vacanamabravi."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1008,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Khāribhāraṃ gahetvāna, pacchato ehi me tuvaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1009,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Paribhutte ca saṅghamhi, puññaṃ tava bhavissati."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1010,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Puṭakaṃ taṃ gahetvāna, bhikkhusaṅghassadāsahaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1011,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tattha cittaṃ pasādetvā, tusitaṃ upapajjahaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1012,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Tattha dibbehi naccehi, gītehi vāditehi ca;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1013,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Puññakammena saṃyuttaṃ, anubhomi sadā sukhaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1014,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Yaṃ yaṃ yonupapajjāmi, devattaṃ atha mānusaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1015,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Bhoge me ūnatā natthi, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1016,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Yāvatā caturo dīpā, sasamuddā sapabbatā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1017,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Phalaṃ buddhassa datvāna, issaraṃ kārayāmahaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1018,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Yāvatā ye pakkhigaṇā, ākāse uppatanti ce;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1019,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tepi me vasamanventi, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1020,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Yāvatā vanasaṇḍamhi, yakkhā bhūtā ca rakkhasā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1021,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Kumbhaṇḍā garuḷā cāpi, pāricariyaṃ upenti me."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1022,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Kummā soṇā madhukārā, ḍaṃsā ca makasā ubho;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1023,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tepi maṃ vasamanventi, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1024,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Supaṇṇā nāma sakuṇā, pakkhijātā mahabbalā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1025,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tepi maṃ saraṇaṃ yanti, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1026,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Yepi dīghāyukā nāgā, iddhimanto mahāyasā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1027,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tepi maṃ vasamanventi, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1028,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Sīhā byagghā ca dīpī ca, acchakokataracchakā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1029,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Tepi maṃ vasamanventi, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1030,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Osadhī tiṇavāsī ca, ye ca ākāsavāsino;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1031,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sabbe maṃ saraṇaṃ yanti, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1032,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Sududdasaṃ sunipuṇaṃ, gambhīraṃ suppakāsitaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1033,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Phassayitvā viharāmi, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1034,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Vimokkhe aṭṭha phusitvā, viharāmi anāsavo;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1035,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Ātāpī nipako cāhaṃ, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1036,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Ye phalaṭṭhā buddhaputtā, khīṇadosā mahāyasā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1037,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Ahamaññataro tesaṃ, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1038,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Abhiññāpāramiṃ gantvā, sukkamūlena codito;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1039,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sabbāsave pariññāya, viharāmi anāsavo."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1040,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Tevijjā iddhipattā ca, buddhaputtā mahāyasā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1041,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Dibbasotaṃ samāpannā, tesaṃ aññataro ahaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1042,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Satasahassito kappe, yaṃ phalaṃ adadiṃ tadā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1043,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1044,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanan”ti."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1045,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Arahattaṃ pana patvāpi tameva gāthaṃ aññābyākaraṇavasena abhāsi."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1046,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Suppiyattheragāthāvaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1047,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Sopākattheragāthāvaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1048,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["<b>Yathāpi ekaputtasmin</b>ti āyasmato sopākattherassa gāthā.","Kā uppatti?","So kira purimabuddhesu katādhikāro hutvā tattha tattha vivaṭṭūpanissayaṃ kusalaṃ upacinanto kakusandhassa bhagavato kāle aññatarassa kuṭumbikassa putto hutvā nibbatto ekadivasaṃ satthāraṃ disvā pasannacitto bījapūraphalāni satthu upanesi.","Paṭiggahesi bhagavā anukampaṃ upādāya.","So bhikkhusaṅghe ca abhippasanno salākabhattaṃ paṭṭhapetvā saṅghuddesavasena tiṇṇaṃ bhikkhūnaṃ yāvatāyukaṃ khīrabhattaṃ adāsi.","So tehi puññakammehi aparāparaṃ devamanussesu sampattiṃ anubhavanto ekadā manussayoniyaṃ nibbatto ekassa paccekabuddhassa khīrabhattaṃ adāsi.","Evaṃ tattha tattha puññāni katvā sugatīsu eva paribbhamanto imasmiṃ buddhuppāde purimakammanissandena sāvatthiyaṃ aññatarāya duggatitthiyā kucchimhi paṭisandhiṃ gaṇhi.","Tassa mātā dasa māse kucchinā pariharitvā paripakke gabbhe vijāyanakāle vijāyituṃ asakkontī mucchaṃ āpajjitvā bahuvelaṃ matā viya nipajji.","Taṃ ñātakā “matā”ti saññāya susānaṃ netvā citakaṃ āropetvā devatānubhāvena vātavuṭṭhiyā uṭṭhitāya aggiṃ adatvā pakkamiṃsu.","Dārako pacchimabhāvikattā devatānubhāvena mātukucchito arogo nikkhami.","Mātā pana kālamakāsi.","Devatā taṃ gahetvā manussarūpena susānagopakassa gehe ṭhapetvā katipayakālaṃ patirūpena āhārena posesi.","Tato paraṃ susānagopako ca naṃ attano puttaṃ katvā vaḍḍheti.","So tathā vaḍḍhento tassa puttena supiyena nāma dārakena saddhiṃ kīḷanto vicarati.","Tassa susāne jātasaṃvaḍḍhabhāvato <b>sopāko</b>ti samaññā ahosi."],"lineRefs":[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]]},{"para":1049,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Athekadivasaṃ sattavassikaṃ taṃ bhagavā paccūsavelāya ñāṇajālaṃ pattharitvā veneyyabandhave oloketvā ñāṇajalantogadhaṃ disvā susānaṭṭhānaṃ agamāsi.","Dārako pubbahetunā codiyamāno pasannamānaso satthāraṃ upasaṅkamitvā vanditvā aṭṭhāsi.","Satthā tassa dhammaṃ kathesi.","So dhammaṃ sutvā pabbajjaṃ yācitvā “pitarā anuññātosī”ti vutto pitaraṃ satthu santikaṃ nesi.","Tassa pitā satthāraṃ upasaṅkamitvā vanditvā “bhante, imaṃ dārakaṃ pabbājethā”ti anujāni.","Satthā taṃ pabbājetvā mettābhāvanāya niyojesi.","So mettākammaṭṭhānaṃ gahetvā susāne viharanto ca cirasseva mettājhānaṃ nibbattetvā jhānaṃ pādakaṃ katvā vipassanaṃ vaḍḍhetvā arahattaṃ sacchākāsi.","Tena vuttaṃ <b>apadāne</b> (apa. thera 2.45.1-7)–"],"lineRefs":[[],[],[],[],[],[],[],[]]},{"para":1050,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Kakusandho mahāvīro, sabbadhammāna pāragū;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1051,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Gaṇamhā vūpakaṭṭho so, agamāsi vanantaraṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1052,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Bījamiñjaṃ gahetvāna, latāya āvuṇiṃ ahaṃ;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1053,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Bhagavā tamhi samaye, jhāyate pabbatantare."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1054,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Disvānahaṃ devadevaṃ, vippasannena cetasā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1055,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Dakkhiṇeyyassa vīrassa, bījamiñjamadāsahaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1056,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Imasmiṃyeva kappamhi, yaṃ miñjamadadiṃ tadā;"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1057,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, bījamiñjassidaṃ phalaṃ."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1058,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanan”ti."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":1059,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Arahā hutvā pana aññesaṃ sosānikabhikkhūnaṃ mettābhāvanāvidhiṃ dassento <b>“yathāpi ekaputtasmin”</b>ti gāthaṃ abhāsi."],"lineRefs":[[]]}]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
